# <<< buildflow-managed (.gitignore) <<<

# Multi-module workspace (2026-09-23 split): go.work MUST stay tracked - CI,
# erraudit module-scoping, and the release gate all resolve sibling modules
# through it. The buildflow block above re-adds go.work/go.work.sum ignores on
# every regeneration (observed 2026-09-23, cost a red CI run), so the negation
# lives OUTSIDE the markers where regeneration cannot remove it.
!go.work
!go.work.sum
